sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as Nguoi dan (Citizen)
    participant UI as React Web App
    participant Ctrl as WasteScanController
    participant Svc as WasteScanService
    participant Repo as AIScanHistoryRepository
    participant Rule as WasteRuleEngineService
    participant DB as PostgreSQL (ApplicationDbContext)

    opt Truong hop 1: Nguoi dung dong y voi ket qua AI
        User->>+UI: 1. Bam 'Xac nhan dung loai rac'
        UI->>+Ctrl: 2. POST /api/v1/waste-scans/{scanId}/confirm
        Ctrl->>+Svc: 3. ConfirmScanAsync(scanId, userId, ct)
        Svc->>+Repo: 4. GetByIdAsync(scanId)
        Repo->>+DB: 5. SELECT * FROM ai_scan_histories WHERE scan_id = @id
        DB-->>-Repo: 6. Return AIScanHistory entity
        Repo-->>-Svc: 7. Return scanHistory
        Svc->>+Repo: 8. UpdateAsync(scanHistory.Confirm())
        Repo->>+DB: 9. UPDATE ai_scan_histories SET confirmed_category_id = predicted_category_id, confirmed_at = NOW()
        DB-->>-Repo: 10. 1 row affected
        Repo-->>-Svc: 11. Complete Task
        Svc-->>-Ctrl: 12. Return true
        Ctrl-->>-UI: 13. 200 OK: ApiResponse<object> (MSG-CLS-05: Xac nhan thanh cong)
        UI-->>-User: 14. Hien thi Toast thanh cong, dieu huong sang 'Dat lich thu gom'
    end

    opt Truong hop 2: Nguoi dung thay sai va tu chon lai bang tay
        User->>+UI: 15. Bam 'Chon loai rac khac' -> Chon danh muc tu Dropdown
        UI->>+Ctrl: 16. PUT /api/v1/waste-scans/{scanId}/adjust (Body: AdjustScanRequestDto)
        Ctrl->>+Svc: 17. AdjustScanAsync(scanId, userId, dto, ct)
        Svc->>+Repo: 18. GetByIdAsync(scanId)
        Repo-->>-Svc: 19. Return scanHistory
        Svc->>+Repo: 20. UpdateAsync(scanHistory.Adjust(newCategoryId))
        Repo->>+DB: 21. UPDATE ai_scan_histories SET confirmed_category_id = newCategoryId, scan_status = 'Completed'
        DB-->>-Repo: 22. 1 row affected
        Repo-->>-Svc: 23. Complete Task
        Svc->>+Rule: 24. GetSortingGuideAsync(newCategoryCode, ct)
        Rule-->>-Svc: 25. Return new WasteSortingGuideDto (Quy chuan phan loai moi)
        Svc-->>-Ctrl: 26. Return WasteScanResponseDto (Huong dan lam sach moi)
        Ctrl-->>-UI: 27. 200 OK: ApiResponse<WasteScanResponseDto> (MSG-CLS-06)
        UI-->>-User: 28. Cap nhat giao dien huong dan lam sach theo loai rac moi chon
    end
